 ----------------  Validate numeric input ---------------

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. NUMREC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT   PIC 9(10) '12345'
01 WS-NUMBER  PIC 9(07).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
   IF WS-INPUT IS NUMRIC 
      MOVE WS-INPUT TO WS-NUMBER 
      DISPLAY 'VALID NUMERIC: ' WS-INPUT
    ELSE 
      DISPLAY 'NON VALID NUMERIC'
   END IF 
  
